```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "move a wiki and its canon bag into a locally named realm"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.wiki.moves", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.wiki.moves"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.wiki.moves"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.wiki.moves ~ move a wiki and its canon bag into a locally named realm

A move places a wiki and its canon bag under a local realm label, minting the destination label when needed and dropping an emptied source label. Its folder follows at a quiet point; its canon realm id stays. The address stays a candidate until the operator reads the list.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ move

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`move` params=`slug/works to/Garden ~ move a wiki and its canon bag into a locally named realm`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug · to

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki slug`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the destination realm pet name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the host reads or writes its local projections; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · realm-slug-malformed · realm-slug-private · realm-unnamed · realm-name-empty · realm-name-separator · realm-name-colon · realm-name-nul · realm-name-leading-dot · realm-name-collision · realm-name-face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ name the required arguments`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-slug-malformed` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ name a path-safe wiki slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-slug-private` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ choose a wiki outside the private face projections`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-unnamed` params=`cure/[[realm.label.reads]] ~ read the local labels and choose a standing realm`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-empty` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ name a realm destination`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-separator` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without path separators`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-colon` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without a colon`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-nul` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without a NUL`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-leading-dot` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ choose a name without a leading dot`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-collision` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ choose a name apart from other realm names`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`realm-name-face` params=`cure/[[realm.wiki.moves slug/works to/Garden]] ~ choose a name apart from face names`>>
```

